235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 125 0 R
/E (The client actively measures the real elapsed download time for each segment to calculate current network throughput in kbps. The algorithm averages the last three measurements to filter network noise, applies a strict 70% safety factor, and selects the highest sustainable quality from the available 64, 128, 192, or 320 kbps bitrates.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
